{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_031_title", "source_sha256": "fad24c5d8881b560a609a38d5550dbc26c2d66c692c05fcc56e15fda7db6e245", "ja": "まほうじゃない、まほう", "zh": "不是魔法的魔法", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_031_synopsis", "source_sha256": "c65b2ef8bddec30e0ee22e13c6020330d4c0c8184301ea3981532830caf3f878", "ja": "センターの育は、はりきってレッスンの\n進行役も引き受ける。だがプロデューサーに\n「大人もみんなに助けてもらっている」と\n仲間に頼る事の大切さをアドバイスされ、\n自分もみんなと一緒に頑張る事を決める。", "zh": "担任Center的育干劲十足，\n同时接下了带领练习课程的职责。\n但制作人表示「大人同样会寻求他人帮助」，\n提醒了她依靠伙伴的重要性，\n而育自己也决定和大家一同努力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_031_1000_p", "source_sha256": "5c4dd4defc86ed42deea195c9cf9810a6277c03d51d16472bb8a0939f104a8fc", "ja": "（次の公演は育を中心に、ひなた、亜利沙、そして\n美奈子とエミリーがサポート、という編成になった）", "zh": "（下次的公演将以育为中心，并采取日向、亚利沙、\n美奈子、以及艾蜜莉从旁协助的编制。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_031_1001_032emi", "source_sha256": "22a47e70ea00f991faa2ac86bfea0935b9f7edb3ee91a11a34f0fa4967abce5e", "ja": "育さん。\nこの度は主役公演、おめでとうございます。", "zh": "小育，\n恭喜你本次担任公演的主角。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_031_1002_032emi", "source_sha256": "3670bca8539494aa3e81f84937dd77d8655d06b889a3923b74380cb3e7cfc629", "ja": "私も、全力でお手伝いさせていただきます。\n一緒に立派な大和撫子を目指しましょうね♪", "zh": "我也会倾全力协助。\n我们一起以优秀的大和抚子为目标吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_031_1003_030iku", "source_sha256": "04b9457f34805f5b02df1a81ca8a64c202cdfcfc01e0218d92fc2d9f38f75102", "ja": "エミリーさん、ありがとう！\nうん、よろしくね！", "zh": "艾蜜莉，谢谢你！\n嗯，请多指教喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_031_1004_028ari", "source_sha256": "e741e6ade08a61d23765792348c945cd0e63066998ac98d0bace3f3bc326403b", "ja": "育ちゃんの、記念すべき初センター公演……ムフフ♪\nありさ、全ての記録を収めるつもりでがんばりますっ！", "zh": "这是小育值得纪念的首次Center公演……唔呼呼♪\n亚利沙会努力把全程记录下来的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_031_1005_p", "source_sha256": "1f0b6a578d3617de06057bc1cab8bab819b12ae1e46392041a951dd406d317e5", "ja": "記録もいいけど、亜利沙も出演者だから。\n忘れないようにな！", "zh": "亚利沙，帮忙记录是很好，\n但是别忘了你也要上场啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_031_1006_035hin", "source_sha256": "f2cdc192a25968768bad005e0f4fb98a12b377bb032483612a585ef493aa87b6", "ja": "あたしも、一緒に出させてもらうことになったよぉ。\n育ちゃん、楽しみだねぇ。", "zh": "我也会一起上台表演喔～\n小育，好令人期待哪～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_031_1007_030iku", "source_sha256": "87cdac380eccf52dac020ba5f5c0241e2fa94605845663a60a2d82d621c66b8e", "ja": "うん！　亜利沙さんもひなたちゃんも、\nみんなで、すごいライブにしようね！", "zh": "嗯！亚利沙姊姊、小日，\n大家一起办一场很棒的演唱会吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_031_1008_p", "source_sha256": "9f5e2d220941efdaaf41388e94867f407bb3baa7b1b1de1ae394f96dcf974174", "ja": "気合い十分だな！\nあ……そうだ、美奈子。ちょっといいか？", "zh": "看来大家干劲十足呢！\n啊……对了，美奈子，可以借一步说话吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_031_1009_019min", "source_sha256": "c760f5fa120729fa40b108538ec77f2a9473af5382f662a65af2f75493dd6fa3", "ja": "なんですか？　{$P$}さん。\nもしかして、お腹が空いちゃったんですか？", "zh": "怎么了吗，{$P$}先生？\n该不会是你肚子饿了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_031_1010_p", "source_sha256": "af59304e00f99d022f7ff2e498365fc93dd115f213feec496c3b32cb29d4e82c", "ja": "いや、そうじゃなくて。実は、今週は仕事の都合で、\nみんなのレッスンに付き添えない日がありそうなんだ。", "zh": "不是，我不饿。是这样的，这周我因为工作的关系，\n可能有几天没办法陪大家一起练习。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_031_1011_p", "source_sha256": "d23e022cec016bb6a669a8c9d44e4ffc63cc2003143cc7189f1095a3d62f4317", "ja": "美奈子は最年長だし、俺の代わりにまとめ役というか、\nレッスンの進行役を頼みたいんだけど、いいか？", "zh": "美奈子，这边你最年长，我想请你代替我带领大家，\n指示大家进行练习课程，可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_031_1012_019min", "source_sha256": "e1fbe3bb5c38ef11c2557d0797c820116f000ec550524a134d6d9510dd0d4205", "ja": "もちろんです、まかせてください！", "zh": "当然可以，请交给我吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_031_1013_030iku", "source_sha256": "66ec72b36aa11a714224f15150fb7b28c90820087005042255af8254d404e160", "ja": "もう！　{$P$}さん、美奈子さん？\nふたりで、ないしょ話しないで！", "zh": "真是的！{$P$}先生、美奈子姊姊！\n你们不要偷偷讲悄悄话！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_031_1014_030iku", "source_sha256": "a1b13df9b541875262d5ec2677aff6c08d8378f273d6e75037af5da34e186971", "ja": "{$P$}さん？　公演の主役は\nわたしだよ？　だからここは、わたしにまかせて！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，这次公演的主角是我喔！\n所以练习课程也应该交给我！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_031_1015_019min", "source_sha256": "f4e3ebd7ed019114efce744dd32182d1675609fd7f5df6940daa4973877ba549", "ja": "えっ？\nでも……育ちゃん、センターなのに大丈夫？", "zh": "什么？\n可是……小育，你是Center，这样没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_031_1016_p", "source_sha256": "c37455de76aef40032f0bfa3e3848c23ddf40f0209a0829eb50cd21f45f66444", "ja": "育、センターにはやる事がたくさんあるんだ。\nレッスンのまとめ役は、美奈子に任せた方が……。", "zh": "育，Center有很多事情要做。\n我看还是交给美奈子带领练习会比较好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_031_1017_030iku", "source_sha256": "0bd9fd991054229decbb8cea86c6ec045fe50ecd9bda7bdce4d956b2deee4dc1", "ja": "平気だよ！　やることいっぱいでも。わたし、\nレッスンのだんどり、ノートに書いてきたんだから！", "zh": "没问题的！就算要做的事情很多，\n但我已经把练习的流程都写在笔记本上了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_031_1018_030iku", "source_sha256": "bfa00a6a50d2828c1053366dd43b3e2f6539f7cbe97d17a3318954b5d4045064", "ja": "それを見ながら、やればいいんだよね？\nだからまとめ役も、わたしにやらせて！　いいよね？", "zh": "只要照流程来就好了吧？\n所以就交给我来带领大家吧！这样可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_031_1019", "source_sha256": "8770d1aee1037fa50a1c1ea6decb3e4aa5fe341f97bf1e3a263c2d9ed5317ddb", "ja": "……わかった", "zh": "……我明白了", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_031_2000_p", "source_sha256": "15edd8a9ec6922a25226061597fb59d4cdea22a8430cc3d28130089792e6e1d7", "ja": "育がそこまで言うなら、まとめ役も任せよう。\nでも、大変だと思ったらすぐに言うんだぞ。いいな？", "zh": "既然育这么坚持，那就由你来带领大家吧。\n不过，要是你觉得太辛苦，要马上说喔，知道吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_031_2001_030iku", "source_sha256": "84ecf245013a00446a91ad6923f1091ac418a22f14e5877aedd42e2a4cb14d6d", "ja": "大丈夫、ちゃんとできるよ。\n見ててね、{$P$}さん！", "zh": "放心，我做得到的。\n你要看仔细啰，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_031_2002_030iku", "source_sha256": "a45e383e2edb7e93a58414d528f4b925a99922f56493a0cfec8067b042e96316", "ja": "それじゃあみんな、レッスンを始めるよ！\nまずは、じゅうなん体操からだよ。二人一組になって！", "zh": "好，大家，要开始练习啰！\n先从柔软操开始，两人一组！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_031_2003_019min", "source_sha256": "64fb400fce55c56e1d5a73678843987512eaf3cde7f7a7cac9340c010b4d7300", "ja": "育ちゃんはひなたちゃんとペアで、\n亜利沙ちゃんはエミリーちゃんと組んでもらって……。", "zh": "小育和日向一组、\n亚利沙和艾蜜莉一组……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_031_2004_019min", "source_sha256": "d25d5a19463d0caa5abc35841612ae8431d5e5518b82764ac4cd6657588d0395", "ja": "あれ？　ひとり余っちゃいましたね。\n{$P$}さん、お願いしていいですか？", "zh": "咦？多了一个人呢。\n{$P$}先生，可以麻烦你吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_031_2005_p", "source_sha256": "72ba40ac3b0701d6dc4ecc415c2de8e25f56bdcecb5981832283361ec454efd8", "ja": "ああ、手伝うよ。", "zh": "好，我也来帮忙吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_031_2006_030iku", "source_sha256": "c7ccec42e61d44de7f3cf95c8b15d80dccdbd918731d89c9234313ca46ff3631", "ja": "{$P$}さん、ありがとう！\nみんな、わたしたちも、しっかりやろうね！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，谢谢！\n各位，我们也要好好加油喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_031_2007_032emi", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_031_2008_035hin", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_031_2009_028ari", "source_sha256": "2b2d0c9726c62d4794e4484bae319b59c94619fd2d27ffbee8c5119d8b3b601a", "ja": "はーい！", "zh": "好的──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
