{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_031_2011_null", "source_sha256": "a643276fac463f5e06ddf29dab1f31b8e2c7f7bb284470f7983baf09f788ee39", "ja": "そして……。", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_031_2012_030iku", "source_sha256": "88284a8bec22f17f31a505b2fa1171d29af7b1cfd1f8191d51c4e48e602444ea", "ja": "ふぅ……。それじゃあ、次はダンスの練習だよ。最初は\n『Thank You!』のフォーメーションからね。", "zh": "呼……好，接下来是舞蹈练习喔。\n先从『Thank You!』的表演队型开始喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_031_2013_028ari", "source_sha256": "1fe37ce8bb956d5a5e52f35b3ef57372ba76ae592314b8ae88719dfc7e40921b", "ja": "ムフフ、待ってました！　ありさ、このメンバーでの\n『Thank You!』を、極めたいと思います！", "zh": "唔呼呼，终于等到啦！\n亚利沙要彻底掌握这组成员演出的『Thank You!』！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_031_2014_030iku", "source_sha256": "4b981dd60906e10779cc05b6ee5e3c24952dc715f21825d7d5e9cfec9efdea4a", "ja": "ワン、ツー、スリー、フォー！\nあれ？　ひなたちゃん、そっちじゃないよ！", "zh": "1、2、3、4！\n咦？小日，不是那边喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_031_2015_035hin", "source_sha256": "5f0a1de93460767ccd75c0f8f99787dfc8c8605162959afa72ddceaa5c9bb44a", "ja": "ありゃあ、間違ってしまったべさ。\nワン、ツー、スリー、フォー……あれれ？", "zh": "哎呀，我弄错了哪。\n1、2、3、4……哎呀呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_031_2016_032emi", "source_sha256": "3692df2baef8ac28fa6ed579e6a55953320ff6cac41ce339a0b21ed16fec4b63", "ja": "いつも歌や舞を披露している曲でも、\n立ち位置が変わると、やっぱり大変ですね。", "zh": "即使是经常表演的歌曲和舞蹈，\n只要换个位置，就会很不习惯呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_031_2017_035hin", "source_sha256": "a321bcab584bbe87473e6efbf64b4aaff499b8ad65d8346a7768b8c36794d09d", "ja": "うん、難しいねぇ……。\nあたし、もっとがんばらねばだわぁ。", "zh": "嗯，好难喔……\n我得更加努力才行哪～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_031_2018_030iku", "source_sha256": "09c659282465cbfb9bbd9376fba8eabeeff6f6e225b6ec8b49a057df7872a2db", "ja": "ちがうよ、ひなたちゃん！　今のは、わたしが\nちゃんとこっちだって言わなかったからだよ。", "zh": "小日，不是你的错！\n刚才是因为我没有先说好要站哪边。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_031_2019_030iku", "source_sha256": "0f70a43890043da63d3d21baa0eaaff961a1749db0b4cfd5b84e6221aa08226d", "ja": "まかせてって言ったのに、ごめんね……。", "zh": "我自己说要交给我带领的，对不起……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_031_2020_019min", "source_sha256": "2bd5bc90795927f0b4d5da9993046e71e319147a3057054660d40bc24bf8aa72", "ja": "育ちゃんもひなたちゃんも、何も悪くないよ。\nみんなで協力して練習すれば、大丈夫！", "zh": "小育、日向，你们都没有错喔。\n只要大家同心协力练习，一定没问题的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_031_2021_028ari", "source_sha256": "068e2467c46c14ffd7adde5d56fa3de84b1a0c7143a5d81b3e117ff3c95730e2", "ja": "そうですよね。\nありさも、もう1度最初からやってみます！", "zh": "就是说啊。\n亚利沙也会从头试试的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_031_2022_p", "source_sha256": "bd4699a71eb6150c8cfd5bcaf618983a1bc06f63c6f6db099e11dc1a60d320de", "ja": "みんな、その前に……ちょうどいいタイミングだし、\nここでいったん休憩しようか。", "zh": "各位，在那之前……现在时间刚好，\n就先休息片刻吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_031_2023_030iku", "source_sha256": "6dd102bff24ce7ac4015a27bbca96ef350a8198156d16ad74a2d3620b1c9ddb1", "ja": "{$P$}さん……わかった。\nみんな、きゅうけいにしよう！", "zh": "{$P$}先生……好吧。\n大家先休息吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_031_2024_p", "source_sha256": "86f5466a1e3bb845a19e8d3904ccfbd31f91a2233fd9c18c097e4ffb24ac8a9f", "ja": "育、お疲れさま。やっぱり、みんなに指示を出しながら\n自分もレッスンするのは、大変じゃないか？", "zh": "育，辛苦你了。\n对大家下指示，自己同时也要练习，果然很累人吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_031_2025_030iku", "source_sha256": "4cd0305637a8c8408cb9a2b9b970a9d44d7c833d62e87bd8d098eb826402a079", "ja": "う、ううん、大丈夫！\n子どもあつかいしないで！", "zh": "不、不会，没事的！\n别把我当小孩子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_031_2026_p", "source_sha256": "b8a1c7532ad2868fcfc9947467d41b2515c6e5c240c64f5d5f9cd1478b92b917", "ja": "別に、育を子ども扱いしてるわけじゃないよ。\nただ……。そうだな、みんなを見てごらん。", "zh": "育，我并没有把你当小孩子喔。\n只是……这个嘛，你看看大家吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_031_2027_030iku", "source_sha256": "1a4683e5c48a0755c32546f3028d8ff8771038ec895b05bdb0e740b28dfb1b52", "ja": "みんなを……？", "zh": "看看大家……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_031_2028_035hin", "source_sha256": "b0388c079931fdece695cb69200e2959e16eef9070b178c2a1342a0bdf884291", "ja": "さっきのところ、ターンしてから\nどうすればいいんだったっけなぁ……？", "zh": "刚才那边，转完圈之后，\n应该要怎么做哪……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_031_2029_028ari", "source_sha256": "4f5edd4ecadb0b1b6e530f4c35393efcc952907acc4bb89a8d0de96cb101c80d", "ja": "じ、実はありさ、途中からちょっとパニックで……\n適当にごまかしちゃった部分がありまして……。", "zh": "其、其实亚利沙到一半就慌了起来……\n所以有些部分是随便跳跳蒙混过去……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_031_2030_032emi", "source_sha256": "11d7a99cb62c14427c5a44b92e2209f3536d4f59acdb90ee8594f3b26d89db95", "ja": "亜利沙さんは、私の後に。\nその後に、ひなたさんが続けば大丈夫ですよ。", "zh": "亚利沙要到我身后。\n之后只要跟着日向就没问题了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_031_2031_019min", "source_sha256": "02f345cb15532b272c55770595f266dc4fe4993dbe2c66e537344069ce84e4c3", "ja": "じゃあ最初だけ、みんなで声を掛け合ってみようか？\nそうしたら、ぶつからないと思うし。", "zh": "那么就在一开始的地方，大家互相提醒如何呢？\n这样应该就不会撞到了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_031_2032_028ari", "source_sha256": "412c3383ec8af7b7ff90c261a2e9846ef8e3e80eb9f2c63da09b1717781f2824", "ja": "なるほど、なるほど！\nひなたちゃん、今のでわかりましたか？", "zh": "原来如此、原来如此！\n日向，刚刚说的你听懂了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_031_2033_035hin", "source_sha256": "8289cdf3f9f85e88503cb36b874a6dd784ecbcc3a96a362629f7f29a7767a204", "ja": "うん！　今ので大丈夫だべさ。\nエミリーちゃん、ありがとねえ。", "zh": "嗯！刚才那样说我就懂哪。\n艾蜜莉，谢谢你喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_031_2034_032emi", "source_sha256": "3b23f02c69755896c77129c3f695cb47f4961d3dfd63c8bacc4fa638c0901883", "ja": "いいえ。\nお役に立ててよかったです♪", "zh": "不会。\n很高兴能帮上忙♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_031_2035_028ari", "source_sha256": "4e78049858745c25b202bf46f0788bb5e8c1cc25b52daad9b6937f0d2e3f70d0", "ja": "すみません！\nありさ、もう1回聞きたいです！", "zh": "不好意思！\n亚利沙希望再听一次！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_031_2036_030iku", "source_sha256": "4a1d58c14ae3bbb720c4e7882a08b8f5fd3f921be9ac6f4a0e991ab73da57516", "ja": "ええと……。\n亜利沙さんが、ダンスを覚えてない……？", "zh": "所以重点是……\n亚利沙姊姊记不起舞蹈吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_031_2037_p", "source_sha256": "c7775a07ceef3b27bb7f99b76b1fc628d19b2467b26cd0aa607c10b9a1aa6bf5", "ja": "そ、そうじゃなくて……。ほら、みんなで\n色々アイディアを出して、助け合ってるだろ？", "zh": "我、我不是那个意思……你看，\n大家轮流提出各种想法，互相帮助对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_031_2038_p", "source_sha256": "6a6d844731e3674e11403d1b785336bf1aed8e097c39e28b6125027606207067", "ja": "あんな風に、育も、\nもっとみんなに助けてもらっていいんだよ。", "zh": "育，你也可以像那样，\n多让大家帮忙你喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_031_2039_030iku", "source_sha256": "15a737f9a9e641bad88dc73b47b57a9766e63d3ce061a5ae46e3958007ef8089", "ja": "でも大人は、なんでもひとりでできるんじゃないの？\n{$P$}さんだって、ひとりでしょ？", "zh": "可是大人不是什么事情都能一个人做到吗？\n{$P$}先生不也是一个人工作吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_031_2040_p", "source_sha256": "07f09e93f5c5aacc6dbc362e285f01aa57ceb5f449ae76ab96e880e0417b2b29", "ja": "プロデューサーっていう仕事は、ひとりだけど。\n俺も、青羽さんや音無さんや社長に助けられてるんだ。", "zh": "制作人这份工作，虽然基本上只有我一个人做，\n但青羽小姐、音无小姐跟社长还是经常帮忙我喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_031_2041_p", "source_sha256": "86987eb467f3a24c0781e6ba054c1f131487cf064e32798827dd2c72938257a4", "ja": "もちろん育たち、アイドルのみんなにもな。\nだから育も、全部自分でやろうとしなくていいんだよ。", "zh": "育，你们这些偶像当然也给了我很多帮助。\n所以，你不需要独自承担一切喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_031_2042_030iku", "source_sha256": "5cbfbab6dd57cdf303f631180371d6ee5127e8e5e4452575284e2ca02a45cf35", "ja": "{$P$}さんみたいな、\n大人の人も、他の人に手伝ってもらってるんだ……。", "zh": "像{$P$}先生这样的大人，\n原来也会请别人帮忙啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_031_2043_030iku", "source_sha256": "e210c694627f3deccbc8d071644ffd3385b2170e44b498e95a91e033fe7a6d17", "ja": "そうなんだ……。", "zh": "原来是这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_031_2044_p", "source_sha256": "88cb3dd8d1b7b58293790d5986911d08d908e41d8a80d30792fd70e87e1767c0", "ja": "俺はそうだけど、育はどうする？　やっぱり、ひとりで\n頑張るか？　それとも、みんなと一緒に頑張るか？", "zh": "我自己是这么做，但是育打算怎么做呢？\n你还是想一个人努力吗？或者想和大家一起努力呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_031_2045_030iku", "source_sha256": "22f396179de1fe3b6e1481781f30e3a6ac08ff3fcc3ad690ba41f1633dd20d93", "ja": "うん……わかった。\nわたし、みんなと一緒にがんばってみる！", "zh": "嗯……我知道了。\n我会试试看和大家一起努力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_031_2046_030iku", "source_sha256": "e8f069f41be8a43af6c68a5422ae477728b9735be5c1e26059a638205d860441", "ja": "わたしが、ひとりでがんばるより、そのほうがぜったい\nいいステージになるって思うから。", "zh": "因为我觉得比起一个人努力，\n大家一起努力一定能完成更棒的表演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_031_2047_p", "source_sha256": "e0ae819e7503edfd0d2a968e2b091cd7a5ad79ddcada4d8062bc27f6dc94b6a6", "ja": "よし、それじゃ改めて、みんなにお願いしてみよう。\n大丈夫。みんな、喜んで協力してくれるよ。", "zh": "好，那么你再去跟大家说一次，请大家帮忙吧。\n放心，大家一定都很乐意协助的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_031_2048_030iku", "source_sha256": "a8fd86d23e2ad8a21912cf51de4a6ff256c07739ed98f9c7e0cd3ef55152f106", "ja": "うん！", "zh": "嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_031_2049_019min", "source_sha256": "ad0e0e87b9df485f6a66352361f151151d7a9a72a8f2728b4d36f367c01dc087", "ja": "あ、育ちゃん！\n{$P$}さんとのお話は、終わったの？", "zh": "啊，小育！\n你和{$P$}先生谈完了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_031_2050_030iku", "source_sha256": "df6b574309e16903392b6e45b1a894dc51526a0d5a92a737a0c117aabff86f31", "ja": "あ、あの……美奈子さん！\nやっぱり、レッスンの進行係、お願いしてもいい？", "zh": "那、那个……美奈子姊姊！\n我决定还是请你负责带领练习，可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_031_2051_019min", "source_sha256": "72f4139901952d48fde5557c62fa90131d72cb4f59c898a6ccc8aed98b95db1e", "ja": "育ちゃん？", "zh": "小育？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_031_2052_030iku", "source_sha256": "969ac89818e6ff4cf0c05774980f73f8cb13d008ff73b38c64dcae9200f0360b", "ja": "わたし、ひとりでがんばろうとしたけど……\nやっぱり、ちょっとむずかしいみたい。", "zh": "我本来想一个人努力的……\n但好像还是有点困难。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_031_2053_030iku", "source_sha256": "a53a9f19a7917a8684865b17fd742b6ba00cb301b3bb05d8ec4f44f293013c9b", "ja": "でも、ぜったいに、いい公演にしたいの。\nだから……みんなも、お願いします！", "zh": "可是，我真的很想举办一场很棒的公演。\n所以……我想要请大家帮忙！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
